<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetAnimation(AvatarID: uuid): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llGetAnimation(key AvatarID);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is the name of the currently playing locomotion animation for avatar <b>id</b>. See the table below.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>AvatarID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/id" target="_blank">id</a></td>
          <td>avatar <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>avatar</li>
        <li>avatar_animation</li>
        <li>permissions</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">162</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentInfo" target="_blank">llGetAgentInfo</a> provides information on some animation states not covered by this function (typing, away, busy). <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAnimationList" target="_blank">llGetAnimationList</a> provides more detailed information about the running animations, but may not reflect avatar state as accurately as llGetAnimation.</p>
